title: The Clip Is Already Everywhere
subtitle: Without a rapid-response desk, every correction arrives one news cycle late.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_rapid_response_timer <= 0 and media_event_done = 1 and (media_capacity < 40 or far_right_agenda >= 45 or republika_capacity + kanal_zero_capacity > media_capacity)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_rapid_response_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/deck_party.svg

= The Clip Is Already Everywhere

A sentence stripped of context moves from social media to television tickers
before the parliamentary club agrees who should answer. Republika has a line,
KO has a line and a new celebrity commentator has a thumbnail. The Left has a
group chat.

- @professional_desk
- @volunteer_network
- @spokesperson_blitz

@professional_desk
title: Fund a professional rapid-response desk
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Expensive, durable and less glamorous than a studio.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Researchers, regional press officers and training cost two resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; media_capacity += 8; public_trust += 2; party_unity += 1; organiser_energy += 1; turnout_readiness += 2; young_support += 1; primary_tv_ready = 1; news_headline = "The Left answers before tomorrow's newspapers"

Researchers prepare facts, regional officers distribute usable clips and
spokespeople rehearse the coalition question everyone knows is coming. The
correction finally arrives during the story rather than after it.

- #poland_card_finish

@volunteer_network
title: Build a distributed volunteer response network
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. More reach and less message control.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Even a volunteer network needs one resource for tools and training.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_capacity += 4; local_network += 2; organiser_energy += 3; movement_autonomy += 3; barons_dissent += 2; public_trust += 1; young_support += 2; urban_progressive_support += 2; turnout_readiness += 2; primary_tv_ready = 1; primary_movement_slate = 1; news_headline = "Hundreds of small accounts carry the Left response"

Local organisers translate policy, correct falsehoods and answer neighbours.
They do not wait for every line to clear Warsaw. The response feels human and
occasionally says something headquarters would have deleted.

- #poland_card_finish

@spokesperson_blitz
title: Rotate every recognisable MP through television
subtitle: Free reach, inconsistent answers and a fresh internal blame game.
on-arrival: media_capacity += 3; left_poll += 0.2; party_unity -= 2; barons_dissent += 1; spring_dissent += 1; progressives_dissent += 1; public_trust -= 1; young_support += 1; turnout_readiness -= 1; primary_spokesperson_slate = 1; news_headline = "The Left floods the studios and contradicts itself"

For forty-eight hours the party is impossible to ignore. Unfortunately, three
spokespeople give three answers on coalition red lines, and all three clips
remain online.

- #poland_card_finish
